# The ingest image's build context is the repo root (docker/workspace-ingest/Dockerfile, Phase 24a).
# BuildKit reads this file, and not the root .dockerignore, because it sits beside that Dockerfile
# under the Dockerfile's own name.
#
# An allow-list: only the folders that Dockerfile copies from are sent. Every node_modules, dist,
# coverage and .venv folder and every .env file stay out, so nothing host-built and nothing secret
# reaches a layer. `workspace/src` is bundled into the worker (config, db, alive); `ingest/` holds the
# locked Python set and the helpers both services import.
*
!docker/workspace-ingest/
!workspace-ingest/
!workspace/src/
!ingest/pyproject.toml
!ingest/uv.lock
!ingest/extract_text.py
!ingest/pull_files.mjs
!ingest/fetch_signed.mjs
!ingest/embed_corpus.mjs
workspace-ingest/test
workspace-ingest/node_modules
workspace-ingest/dist
workspace-ingest/coverage
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.env
**/.env.*
